    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62454" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπ-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέπος</span>)
